  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Finely chop garlic.\n• In a medium saucepan, melt the butter with a dash of olive oil over medium heat. Cook garlic until fragrant, 1-2 minutes.\n• Add basmati rice, the water (for the rice) and a generous pinch of salt. Stir, then bring to the boil. Reduce heat to low and cover with a lid. Cook for 10 minutes, then remove from heat.\n• Keep covered until rice is tender and water is absorbed, 10 minutes.\n• TIP: The rice will finish cooking in its own steam, so don’t peek!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/689546399643892dc8fbd211/step-2654ad00.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While rice is cooking, trim and halve green beans. Thinly slice carrot into half-moons. Roughly chop Asian greens.\n• Thinly slice long chilli (if using). Cut Japanese tofu into 2cm cubes.\n• Set aside.\n• In a small bowl, combine ponzu, the brown sugar, water (for the glaze) and mixed sesame seeds.\n• In a second small bowl, combine Japanese-style dressing and the mayonnaise.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/689546399643892dc8fbd211/step-9465dd10.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• Cook green beans and carrot with a dash of water, tossing occasionally, until tender, 4-5 minutes. Add Asian greens and cook until wilted, 1-2 minutes. Season with salt. Transfer to a bowl and cover to keep warm.\n• Return frying pan to medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil. Cook tofu, tossing, until golden, 2 minutes. Add ponzu glaze and cook, stirring, until tofu is well coated and glaze is slightly thickened, 1 minute.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/689546399643892dc8fbd211/step-6b599220.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide garlic rice between bowls.\n• Top with ponzu-glazed tofu and veggies.\n• Dollop with Japanese mayo. Sprinkle with chilli to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/689546399643892dc8fbd211/step-40086c30.jpg"
    }
  ]
